[center][size=5][b]Bigger Minotaur Inventory[/b][/size]
Increases the Minotaur technology and cargo slots to 50. Technology gets 2 new rows and both technology and cargo have their blank slots activated.[/center]

Requested by [b][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/profile/TrueWhiteKnight]TrueWhiteKnight[/url][/b] - room for all of the murder mech upgrades 😉

[b]Compatibility[/b]
[list]
[*]Modifies [i]METADATA/REALITY/TABLES/INVENTORYTABLE[/i] (Vehicle entries only). It may conflict with any other mod editing that file[/*]
[*]Pairs well with [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/nomanssky/mods/4697]Bigger Item Grids and Smaller Inventory Slots[/url][/*]
[*]Built for Cosmos[/*]
[/list]

Built natively on Linux with my [url=https://github.com/SavageCore/AMUMSS/tree/feat/linux-support]AMUMSS Linux port[/url].

Source: [url=https://github.com/SavageCore/bigger-minotaur-inventory]https://github.com/SavageCore/bigger-minotaur-inventory[/url]
